Binary Ninja 6 fixes for the "Original Xbox Executable Loader" community plugin
(xclusivor_binaryninjaxbe 1.0, MIT, Copyright 2023 xclusivor). As published, the plugin maps
only the XBE header on BN 6. This patch passes Type.array a Type, reads the kernel thunk table
directly, reports the entry point, classifies sections by name (the linker marks .rdata and .data
executable), stops mapping the TLS directory a second time, and makes XbSymbolDatabase names
outside code sections data symbols.

Apply in the plugin folder (%APPDATA%\Binary Ninja\channels\community\plugins\xclusivor_binaryninjaxbe):
    git apply <repo>/tools/xbe_view-bn6.patch

